WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:13.805 --> 00:00:15.682
Here under three
minutes so get to work.

00:00:17.559 --> 00:00:20.103
There seems to be
multiple sets of appendages.

00:00:21.813 --> 00:00:25.442
Definitely insectoid--
quite stunning.

00:00:27.819 --> 00:00:29.446
When they powered
up the reactor,

00:00:30.030 --> 00:00:32.615
must have drawn them
towards the surface to feed.

00:00:35.994 --> 00:00:36.661
Holy sh*t.

00:00:37.829 --> 00:00:38.621
Oh, my god.

00:00:38.621 --> 00:00:39.706
We gotta go.

00:00:40.373 --> 00:00:41.958
Uh, hey.

00:00:42.542 --> 00:00:44.044
Forget the timeline.
We gotta go.

00:00:44.044 --> 00:00:45.378
- One more minute.
- No, we gotta go now.

00:00:46.337 --> 00:00:47.881
Just go.

00:00:48.465 --> 00:00:49.549
- Look out.

00:00:50.884 --> 00:00:51.885
Get out of there, guys.
Come on.

00:00:51.885 --> 00:00:52.677
Get back here.

00:00:55.305 --> 00:00:56.139
Come on.

00:01:00.643 --> 00:01:01.603
Oh, my god.

00:01:03.438 --> 00:01:04.397
Oh, my god.

00:01:04.397 --> 00:01:05.690
Go, go, go.

00:01:10.403 --> 00:01:11.196
Go, go.

00:01:11.196 --> 00:01:12.322
Keep going.

00:01:14.616 --> 00:01:15.617
Pull!

00:01:16.868 --> 00:01:17.827
Pull!

00:01:25.210 --> 00:01:27.295
Pull! Pull!

00:01:27.295 --> 00:01:28.129
They're coming.

